#: admin/partials/afrsm-pro-list-page.php:299
msgid ""
"%s: We've implemented a new sorting method for shipping rules. Before "
"syncing, we recommend backing up your current shipping methods. Please note "
"that if you have a large number of shipping methods, the sync process may "
"take some time. After the sync is complete, verify that the sorting order is "
"correct to ensure accuracy."
msgstr ""
"%s: Wir haben eine neue Sortiermethode für Versandregeln implementiert. Vor "
"der Synchronisierung empfehlen wir Ihnen, Ihre aktuellen Versandmethoden zu "
"sichern. Bitte beachten Sie, dass der Synchronisierungsprozess bei einer "
"großen Anzahl von Versandmethoden einige Zeit in Anspruch nehmen kann. "
"Überprüfen Sie nach Abschluss der Synchronisierung die Sortierreihenfolge, "
"um die Korrektheit sicherzustellen."

#: admin/partials/afrsm-pro-add-new-page.php:667
#| msgid ""
#| "&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>[qty]</span> - total number of items in cart<br/>"
#| "\n"
#| "                                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>[cost]"
#| "</span> - cost of items<br/>\n"
#| "                                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>[fee "
#| "percent=10 min_fee=20]</span> - Percentage based fee<br/>\n"
#| "                                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>[fee "
#| "percent=10 max_fee=20]</span> - Percentage based fee<br/><br/>\n"
#| "                                        Below are some examples:<br/>\n"
#| "                                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>i."
#| "</strong> 10.00 -> To add flat 10.00 shipping charge.<br/>\n"
#| "                                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>ii."
#| "</strong> 10.00 * <span>[qty]</span> - To charge 10.00 per quantity in "
#| "the cart. It will be 50.00 if the cart has 5 quantity.<br/>\n"
#| "                                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>iii."
#| "</strong> <span>[fee percent=10 min_fee=20]</span> - This means charge 10 "
#| "percent of cart subtotal, minimum 20 charge will be applicable.<br/>\n"
#| "                                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>iv."
#| "</strong> <span>[fee percent=10 max_fee=20]</span> - This means charge 10 "
#| "percent of cart subtotal greater than max_fee then maximum 20 charge will "
#| "be applicable.<br/><br/>\n"
#| "                                        <span class=\"dashicons dashicons-"
#| "info-outline\"></span>\n"
#| "                                        <a href=\"https://docs."
#| "thedotstore.com/article/101-shipping-fee-configuration-form\" "
#| "target=\"_blank\">View Documentation</a><br/>"
msgid ""
"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>[qty]</span> - total number of items in cart<br/>\n"
"                                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>[cost]</span>"
" - cost of items<br/>\n"
"                                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>[fee "
"percent=10 min_fee=20]</span> - Percentage based fee<br/>\n"
"                                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>[fee "
"percent=10 max_fee=20]</span> - Percentage based fee<br/><br/>\n"
"                                        Below are some examples:<br/>\n"
"                                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>i.</strong>"
" 10.00 -> To add flat 10.00 shipping charge.<br/>\n"
"                                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>ii."
"</strong> 10.00 * <span>[qty]</span> - To charge 10.00 per quantity in the "
"cart. It will be 50.00 if the cart has 5 quantity.<br/>\n"
"                                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>iii."
"</strong> <span>[fee percent=10 min_fee=20]</span> - This means charge 10 "
"percent of cart subtotal, minimum 20 charge will be applicable.<br/>\n"
"                                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>iv."
"</strong> <span>[fee percent=10 max_fee=20]</span> - This means charge 10 "
"percent of cart subtotal greater than max_fee then maximum 20 charge will be "
"applicable.<br/><br/>\n"
"                                        <span class=\"dashicons dashicons-"
"info-outline\"></span>\n"
"                                        <a href=\"https://docs.thedotstore."
"com/article/101-shipping-fee-configuration-form\" target=\"_blank\">View "
"Documentation</a>"
msgstr ""
"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>[qty]</span> - Gesamtzahl der Artikel im "
"Warenkorb<br/>\n"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>[cost]</span> - Kosten der Artikel<br/>\n"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>[fee percent=10 min_fee=20]</span> - Prozentuale "
"Gebühr<br/>\n"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>[fee percent=10 max_fee=20]</span> - Prozentuale "
"Gebühr<br/><br/>\n"
"Nachfolgend einige Beispiele:<br/>\n"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>i.</strong> 10,00 -> Um eine "
"Versandkostenpauschale von 10,00 hinzuzufügen.<br/>\n"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>ii.</strong> 10,00 * <span>[qty]</span> - Um 10,00 "
"pro Menge im Warenkorb zu berechnen. Bei einem Warenkorb mit 5 Stück sind es "
"50,00.<br/>\n"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>iii.</strong> <span>[fee percent=10 min_fee=20]"
"</span> - Das bedeutet, dass 10 Prozent des Warenkorb-Zwischenbetrags "
"berechnet werden, mindestens 20,00 werden berechnet.<br/>\n"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>iv.</strong> <span>[fee percent=10 max_fee=20]"
"</span> - Das bedeutet, dass 10 Prozent des Warenkorb-Zwischenbetrags "
"berechnet werden, der höher ist als die max_Gebühr, dann werden maximal 20,"
"00 berechnet.<br/><br/>\n"
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-info-outline\"></span>\n"
"<a href=\"https://docs.thedotstore.com/article/101-shipping-fee-"
"configuration-form\" target=\"_blank\">Dokumentation anzeigen</a>"

